(meta (title "Files") (sort name))

What is not a page is listed by its name, dated by when it was last written,
and served as it is, with a type by its extension. This folder is sorted by
name.

@image["glasnost.svg" #:alt "Three lines, as a menu has"]

A page can show a file, too, and its code is coloured by its language:

@codeblock[#:lang "bjolang" #:file "hello.bjo"]
